@tkvalvik Thanks for filing this issue!

This appears to be related to the underlying `JsonSchemaExporter` API that we use to generate schemas. Calling:

```csharp
var schema = JsonSchemaExporter.GetJsonSchemaAsNode(JsonSerializerOptions.Default, typeof(XElement));
```

Seems to cause this issue as well. I'm transferring this to the dotnet/runtime repo for further investigation in STJ.
